[gd_scene format=3 uid="uid://edge_navigation_region_3d_missing_mesh"]

; `navigation_mesh` omitted entirely, while the region stays visible in the
; tree. Demonstrates `navigationregion3d-requires-navigation-mesh`, a port of
; `navigation_region_3d.cpp:252-260`'s own get_configuration_warnings(): with no
; NavigationMesh set, Godot itself warns "A NavigationMesh resource must be set
; or created for this node to work." One warning, zero errors; renders with no
; baked navmesh geometry.

